03:37.957 --> 03:40.710
for somebody who wants to know how to use React

03:40.710 --> 03:42.390
and how to contribute to React.

03:42.390 --> 03:43.890
There's a whole section about contributing,

03:43.890 --> 03:46.158
the code of conduct, contributing guide.

03:46.158 --> 03:49.530
So, a bunch of stuff, that's really the role of READMEs.

03:49.530 --> 03:51.213
It's like the entry point for somebody

03:51.213 --> 03:53.550
to learn more about your project.

03:53.550 --> 03:55.140
And again, we can see the file here.

03:55.140 --> 03:57.000
It's just like any other file,

03:57.000 --> 04:00.120
